# BOOMELE_2_54_2x20_Male — component wrapper: local KiCad symbol + footprint, LCSC pinned
# in properties (feeds the JLC BOM/CPL fields). J-EXP board-to-board MALE header on the
# Featherweight (2026-07-26: the Featherweight<->CNC-Expansion interconnect became a mezzanine
# STACK — this male header, pins up, mates the Expansion's ZHOURI_2_54_2x20_Female socket
# mounted under that board; supersedes the C9043 IDC ribbon pair).
#
# Part: BOOMELE (Boom Precision Elec) "2.54mm 2*20P", LCSC C50980. Stock check 2026-07-26:
# 3,170 pcs LCSC / 2,373 pcs JLC — fine for low-hundreds; Basic/Extended flag not shown by
# either search UI, re-verify at order time. $0.13-0.17 @ 150+.
# Drawing (LCSC datasheet e9464fd78889415f8a9a878a22eba583.pdf, 2026-07-26) + 3D-model
# cross-check (WRL z −3.0..+8.54mm):
#   plastic base height 2.54mm (model-confirmed: pin tip at base 2.54 + mating pin 6.0 = 8.54)
#   mating pin above base 6.0mm, solder tail 3.0mm, pin 0.64mm sq, pitch 2.54, rows 2.54 apart
#   body 50.8 x 5.0mm; footprint bbox ~51.2 x 5.08mm (pads span 48.26 x 2.54)
# MATED with the ZHOURI 8.5mm socket: board-to-board separation 11.04mm fully seated
# (2.54 base + 8.5 insulator), pin engagement 6.0mm. See the female wrapper + both boards'
# BOARD-INTENT.md for the stack/mirroring rules (footprints UNFLIPPED on both boards).
#
# Pad numbering (verified from the footprint, rot 0): pad 1 = WEST end SOUTH row; odd pins
# south row, even pins north row, columns 1/2 .. 39/40 west->east. IDENTICAL numbering
# geometry to the female footprint — identity pin-1-to-pin-1 mating by construction.

